@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Ingest the local PDFs to Chroma (Vector DB)
POST {{baseUrl}}/rag/ingest
Accept: application/json

###

### Concurrent Batch Ingest (Live Web Scraper)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ingest/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sources": [
    "https://mausam.imd.gov.in/kolkata/"
  ],
  "max_workers": 5
}

###

### Get Supported Voice Languages
GET {{baseUrl}}/voice/languages
Accept: application/json

###

### Synthesize Audio (JSON response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/voice/synthesize-json
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "text": "WeatherGPT is active. Thunderstorms are expected tomorrow in Kolkata.",
  "target_language": "en",
  "source_is_english": true
}

###

### Chat
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": "What is the weather in Kolkata and will there be thunder storms tomorrow?",
  "location": {
    "city": "Kolkata"
  },
  "language": "en",
  "channel": "web"
}

###
